OL,3,ATrump says 'threat' led US to pull
OL,4,Abombers from RAF Fairford
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS media reports suggested that the
OL,7,Fdecision was made due to intelligence
OL,8,Fsuggesting that Iran was plotting a
OL,9,Fdrone attack. The BBC has not confirmed
OL,10,Fthis and Trump has refused to be drawn
OL,11,Fon the question.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
