OL,3,ABadenoch says Tory air defence system
OL,4,Awould be tailored to UK threats as
OL,5,Ashe's questioned over cost
OL,6,
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch tells BBC Breakfast the
OL,8,FUK should be "able to protect
OL,9,Fourselves" after her party pledged to
OL,10,Finvest #10bn in a new air defence
OL,11,Fsystem - which they said was "in
OL,12,Fessence a British 'Iron Dome'"
OL,14,FShe said the programme could be paid
OL,15,Ffor with #1bn earmarked every year for
OL,16,Fa decade, and pointed to her party
OL,17,Fhaving already set out savings in areas
OL,18,Fsuch as welfare and net zero
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
