OL,3,ABadenoch says Tory air defence system
OL,4,Awould be tailored to UK threats as
OL,5,Ashe's questioned over cost
OL,6,
OL,7,FLater speaking to the Today programme,
OL,8,Fshe insists that #10bn would be enough
OL,9,Fto fund the programme, and she wants
OL,10,Fthe system to be "something specific
OL,11,Ffor the kind of threat that we face
OL,12,Fhere"
OL,14,FThe Conservative leader is speaking
OL,15,Ffrom the party's annual conference in
OL,16,FBirmingham - she is due to deliver her
OL,17,Fkeynote speech on Wednesday
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
