OL,3,ASaudi Arabia urged to spare man
OL,4,Asentenced to death over Facebook post
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case has sent shockwaves through
OL,7,FSri Lanka, sparking widespread concern
OL,8,Fand civil society petitions across the
OL,9,Fcountry. Multiple political parties and
OL,10,Fgovernment bodies have co-ordinated
OL,11,Fdiplomatic efforts seeking clemency.
OL,13,FHowever, the family has had no updates
OL,14,Fon his condition since 28 September.
OL,15,FThe Sri Lankan government has
OL,16,Finstructed the family to refrain from
OL,17,Fmaking further statements while
OL,18,Fdiplomatic efforts take place.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
