OL,3,ASeparatist party projected to win
OL,4,AQuebec election, adding new test to
OL,5,ACanada's unity
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadian media project the separatist
OL,8,FParti Quebecois (PQ) will secure a
OL,9,Fminority win in Monday's provincial
OL,10,Felection in Quebec, making Paul
OL,11,FSt-Pierre Plamondon the incoming
OL,12,Fpremier.
OL,14,FIt marks the first time the PQ has been
OL,15,Fin power since 2014. It could prove to
OL,16,Fbe a test for Prime Minister Mark
OL,17,FCarney, setting up confrontations with
OL,18,FQuebec over issues like immigration and
OL,19,Fthe monarchy.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
