OL,3,ASeparatist party projected to win
OL,4,AQuebec election, adding new test to
OL,5,ACanada's unity
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe party has also pledged to hold a
OL,8,Freferendum on Quebec's independence,
OL,9,Fsimilar to a process under way in the
OL,10,Fprovince of Alberta.
OL,12,FThe majority French-speaking province
OL,13,Fhas held other votes on this, in 1980
OL,14,Fand 1995. Polls indicate only 30% of
OL,15,FQuebecers back such a move.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
